  "description_ja": "大阪四大緑地のひとつ「久宝寺緑地」で開催される大会。北地区のランニングコースには膝への負担を軽減するウッドチップが敷き詰められ、緑のトンネルを走れる。メイン会場の陸上競技場には更衣室・観客席があり、家族の応援もしやすい。",
  "description_en": "This race is held in Kyuhoji Ryokuchi, one of the four major green parks in Osaka. The running course in the North District is covered with wood chips that are gentle on the knees, and runners pass through a tunnel of greenery. The main venue, the athletics stadium, has changing rooms and spectator seating, so families can cheer from the stands.",
